pve-compose (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v1.2.0
  * New adopt command: generate lxc.json from an existing container (#3)
  * down shuts the LXC down after compose down, --keep-running to skip (#4)
  * VLAN tag support through the vlan field (#5)
  * apply --yes, keeps stopped containers stopped, keeps MAC/firewall on net0
  * up: grow the rootfs to "disk" after cloning from a template
  * apply: resize rootfs, configure bind mount, warn on storage/template changes
  * config: safe disk units, validated fields, "swap": 0 kept, features honoured
  * plan/up refuse to create a second container for an already mounted directory

